  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_VC32g</defName>
    <label>VC32 Sniper Rifle</label>
    <description>The Visari Corporation competed fiercely with Stahl arms for the contract of a sniper rifle for the armed forces. Both groups used the StA-14 as a baseline, but Visari-Corporations skill for over-engineering saw their contract gain popularity with the marksmen of the Helghan army. To help stabilize the weapon and keep it accurate at distance, its internals were changed to a bolt action fire. As a second-generation sniper rifle, the VC32 was intended to be something of a 'mass production' model despite its powerful performance and high cost.</description>
	<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Helghast/Weapons/VC32</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
	  <drawSize>1.2</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
	<equippedAngleOffset>45</equippedAngleOffset>
