  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_Vns12Ag</defName>
    <label>VnS-12A Purger</label>
    <description>The 'purger' was a popular 'light minigun' or 'assault minigun' hybrid rifle created to act as a lighter alternative to earlier man portable squad suppression weapons of the Helghast armed forces. Unlike its other ballistic counterparts like the Pulver and Keyzer, the Purger was overproduced and came far over budget compared to Stahl's other 'next generation' weapons updates. While the Purger does use conventional ballistics, advanced fire control computers, partial magnetic acceleration, speed loading mechanisms, and a powerful engine all combined in a metallic polymer frame it still somehow comes in lighter than any prior helghan man portable rotary cannon. Short of a true charge firing mechanism this may be the best, most accurate bullet-hose a spacer society can produce without some kind of compromise. VnS was of course, quite proud of its accomplishment, but it only received a limited rollout and often needed to support more conventional GPMG's due to its outrageous costs and long production time. Helghast armories meticulously care for the dozen delicate electronic systems on the firearm, and there is serious doubt that this weapon could be realistically mass produced in a large scale war.</description>
